es, and no cross-layer shortcuts.","No migrations or debts apply to the changed files: CitationModal.tsx and CitationModal.test.tsx prefix-overlap no active migration paths and no debt paths (DEBT-CHAT-AREA and DEBT-SIDEBAR cover ChatArea.tsx and Sidebar.tsx, which are untouched in this diff), so no no-growth constraint is engaged and nothing regresses.","AC-1 alignment: inside the dialog (role=dialog, aria-label 'Video citation') a section headed 'Transcript Excerpt' is rendered in the content column below the video player block, containing citation.snippet verbatim, while the YouTube iframe (title 'YouTube video player') remains rendered alongside — the test asserts all three via stable, behavior-level queries.","AC-2 alignment: the multi-line checkpoint matches with a no-op normalizer and exact textContent equality against the verbatim expected string, and the snippet element carries white-space: pre-wrap as an inline style so jsdom getComputedStyle observes it — directly addressing the whitespace-normalizer trap from the prior failed build of this issue.","Presentation-only as contracted: no backend, ingest, API, or schema change, no client-side truncation or reformatting of snippet content, and the contradicting negative test ('does not render a transcript snippet section') is replaced in the same acceptance-test file while all other tests (kept-behaviour and formatTimestamp) are byte-identical in the diff.","Convergence improves: the citation modal now fulfills more of its single responsibility (citation inspection) through the same stable interface, keeping one module per responsibility rather than seeding a parallel snippet module ahead of the planned follow-up focus-management work on this same seam."],"verdict":"conform","version":"1.0"},"architecture_builder_sha256":"add49493cb387e18a5a11f01d22581a8e550b1051c793ca6310995e08877c5ac","architecture_guard":{"artifact":"/home/runner/work/_temp/dark-factory/runs/issue-181-a1-6efb048866/artifacts/final-green-pro